{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"41c5a717d3e43f63",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Want to do good but can’t. Makes someone else, someone stronger do it for them. Is it their good that’s been done?\n\nI’ve created good where there was none.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":400,
			"width":260,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"dc87991df32a396f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Certainty at a cost",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":640,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"47d8404a0b853a8a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Iwabo is a game about control. And fear. The balance between acceptance and defiance. Family. Conservation.**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":720,
			"width":260,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"6e89f2a5bf8c3e73",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Themes / Questions / Philosophy",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-820,
			"y":320,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"fe86ab82480ab065",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Act I",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1740,
			"y":560,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"2729e36c5f914380",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"B route in act 1 is seeking therapy\n\nSo essentially:  \nI want to sell the player on the impending apocalypse. Easiest way to, regardless of actual “cause” is to create a meta narrative reinforcing that belief. B route end is waking up at the beginning after facing the uncertainty, mirroring a game over screen. Time limit during the day suggests urgency to act (and could be complete bullshit). The further you fall behind on prepping, the more it seems to be on the news. A heartbeat sound somewhere in the far distance. The screen tinting to a shade of red over time. Things like that.\n\nYou alleviate these symptoms by working towards the bunker.\n\nOr, by seeking therapy.\n\nIn that case the secret end ends the world actually. Haha",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1700,
			"y":860,
			"width":260,
			"height":760
		},
		{
			"id":"9072b482a13764b5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- Rent transport vans, tetris furniture\n- Multiple vans per day possible\n- If you get a driver -> iwabo (they know location)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1700,
			"y":640,
			"width":260,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"7e50a73aa905894f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"14.09.2024",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1300,
			"y":520,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"515aed9087b74054",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"[Perspective Paintings, Religion](https://www.youtube.com/shorts/EN0PHj0P__M)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-500,
			"y":400,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"4ebaee4e4165a938",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"What point is served by telling someone they have to apologise?\n\n  \n\nMany of the character driven story beats depend on Daryl’s input. But even the best advice wouldn’t be as essential in shaping them into “good” people, if they had any outside influence whatsoever.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-500,
			"y":480,
			"width":260,
			"height":300
		},
		{
			"id":"89dee6aa8e70af46",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"It is an examination of Pascal’s wager through the lens of the ethics of care.\n\nRelational Ethics?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-500,
			"y":800,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"f2bf35a697037258",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- Assumed authority\n- Consequent responsibility \n- Fear and Failure\n- Family",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":400,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"9f8b28e6eae10159",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**building a foundation before you know any better. And the disproportionate value we as a society attribute to sticking to it.**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":540,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"e7a7183d5b297ca4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Heidegger and dwelling**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":700,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"4aa76be0a4ea6aa6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Nudity and the Church**\nCount Sternberg",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":780,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"e8f765f8f5ecbcd1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Leviathanism\nalmighty force presiding over peace",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":860,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"89397f60e4408000",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"References",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":160,
			"y":340,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"784d8b017920038a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Btb Josh Duggar",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":180,
			"y":420,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"06efd442755c895b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Women need to “die to themselves”\n\n“You are a help meat”\n\n“Accept gods creation order”\n\n->complementarianism",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":900,
			"width":260,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"69c319a2f9c95d34",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Homeschooling -> save children from the evil secular world.\n\n“They had a plan for women, we didn’t. That’s why they’re winning”\n\nParrallel to men and Tate?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-500,
			"y":960,
			"width":260,
			"height":240
		},
		{
			"id":"b4513b8fa529cc9c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Culture “war”\n\nQuiverful by [Kathryn Joyce](https://www.amazon.de/-/en/Kathryn-Joyce/e/B001JSBTGG/ref=dp_byline_cont_book_1)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":180,
			"y":500,
			"width":260,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"549625d9b7e3557d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"moral majority\nex: Abortion wasn’t always a contentious issue",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":980,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"fa2adbb00d164a6f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Bill Gothard\nInstitute to basic life principles",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":180,
			"y":600,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"1f4b4f10e255500b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\"Meet them where they are\"\n->Bikers/Skaters for Christ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":1100,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"8f14555dd4765bc3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Offer a (false) plan for an impossible situation \n\n(How to build your bunker guide)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":1120,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"613e58c0f4ee9010",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Religion is helpful bc it gives clear instructions and sense of agency/order to traumatic events?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":1200,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"6c22ef6813709ec7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"UX",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-480,
			"y":-500,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"a385a299b8f8f8d5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Morale",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-120,
			"y":-500,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"6cd83b9d0d1969e0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Walls closing in, letterboxing, the lower the mood",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-420,
			"y":-420,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"fcff41e5e11fa2e9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Rim world mood buffs, adding up, trigger rolls.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-80,
			"y":-420,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"eef49cfa59ec1f0c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Traits",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":240,
			"y":-500,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"724fa120ebc5d20b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Make skill checks easier or harder by setting “goal “ with better or worse rewards.**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":280,
			"y":-420,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"e99e7492460264a9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Consider the groups that would wind up in the bunker, the traits between them, overlaps, differences, use that as basis for the skills/items",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":280,
			"y":-300,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"78515ed3d9826e25",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Skills:\nIntrusive thoughts",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":280,
			"y":-140,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"30f7b4758debd41e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The main menu is a fridge with child drawings etc?\nThe fridge represents the need to conserve and coldness it takes to do what’s necessary. The family is put front and center yet feels tacked on and somewhat shallow. The food inside, over time, turns.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-420,
			"y":-340,
			"width":260,
			"height":240
		},
		{
			"id":"f8237c74da98e94b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Use marble sculpture?\n\nReligious connotation\nMisconception and idealization of a past that never was",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-420,
			"y":-80,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"96cbf7201f5e4bfa",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Environment",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-960,
			"y":-500,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"5e9ef47ae898ce46",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Silo the only place for a tree\nOr a trash heap",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-900,
			"y":-420,
			"width":260,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"7cab449332d44b05",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Go even further?\nif something major happens:\nThe father realises, the marble cracks!",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-420,
			"y":80,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"5aa92fc7a84c37e3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Dice - Gambler, +1 on all checks, can see the odds?**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":280,
			"y":-60,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"a5d047ea6d936a61",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Dumbbells\nYou’re strong and fit and the other things. True alpha.\n\nMaintaining your mass means eating more, spending time exercising and costly equipment. \n\nCan’t pay too much for beauty.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":280,
			"y":20,
			"width":260,
			"height":260
		},
		{
			"id":"47ac10f1ef8d89d9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**How much do you need to do, and what to be a “good person”**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-500,
			"y":1220,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"f2f49b50fe13d130",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Terrorists dwelling caves**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":1180,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"495ade149062d288",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Carver clementine dialogue boss battle twd s 2**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":180,
			"y":680,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"1584922057b37837",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Playing hide and seek kid goes where they shouldn’t",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":-1480,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"c35d16af55d4b6b6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Playing hide and seek; kid “too old”",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":-1400,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"b1002a74d430f23a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Runs out of paper (starts painting on walls)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":-1320,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"9a651d3a97ffaebc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Runs out of Paint (starts using rations)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":-1240,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"3577b29cdaac3450",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The Kids talk about what they would have been, had things been different.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-100,
			"y":-1480,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"5da253915011c183",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Already at the bunker?\n\nWatch the sun go down before locking yourself in.\n\nBirds flying low.\n\n  \n\nWaiting for the end? Sundown.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-100,
			"y":-1360,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"d2734bc25e601a19",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"April does the dust blow cave painting, using June as the model\n\nNaturally June is covered head to toe in dust\nYou find her, June laughing April looking ertappt\nHuge mess\n\nArt critic\n-> will notice the implication\nDo you commend the work?\nDo you shut it down?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":180,
			"y":-1480,
			"width":260,
			"height":360
		},
		{
			"id":"c834f24f09d65a50",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"June tries to carry a heavy food bucket and drops it. Do you try and scrape it back in? Accept the loss, scold her?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":-1160,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"533b340871aac769",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Rushing to the bunker. Heavy storm to dead of night.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-100,
			"y":-1160,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"46b9fc42fd967549",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**You’re not going to win any awards with that one**\n\nOkay? Who cares?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-100,
			"y":-1080,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"058433a186414683",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Go full religion. Play baroque music preach from the pulpit that is the service stair to the second floor.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":-1020,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"49fa71902537efd9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"He takes April hunting again, she needs to learn\n\nI don’t want to kill it\n\nYou cant afford to be that person if you want to survive with us.\n\nAnd you not surviving with us is not an option.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-380,
			"y":-880,
			"width":260,
			"height":280
		},
		{
			"id":"649821d928f6ef1c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Tree roots growing through ceiling",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-660,
			"y":-1320,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"c807c990547bebd8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Accidents, sickness, someone chokes on food",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-660,
			"y":-1240,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"67ac1e34c17e5e1b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**The storm is a day early**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-660,
			"y":-1160,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"723e287c0c2b287e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"They fight over their interpretations of a book. But not over what’s right or wrong, but rather over who gets the book",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-660,
			"y":-1080,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"a0feed149ec2f74b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Events",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-700,
			"y":-1560,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"38957ccd05ffcd21",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Hunting ghosts (?)\nNo matter how many books, always more outside\n\nContinuations\n\nEmergency",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-660,
			"y":-1480,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"9e808b2dada093e2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Someone falls into the rising water in the silo\n\nThey swim in standing water",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-660,
			"y":-920,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"869d142a688edb7d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Is Greek tragedy\nIt’s oedipus from the perspective of the father\n\nIt’s cronos \nDevouring child-> April watching younger self consumed, Daryl huge, eyes wide open, caught in the act, afraid",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":1260,
			"width":260,
			"height":260
		},
		{
			"id":"7448ba66724fffc5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Much like Daryl spending loads of food and time on gym maxing, eventually the player notices Mary-Ann “letting herself go”. The player can accept or respect this, but also call it out. Which may lead to her becoming much less effective at everything else. Time and effort spent on looking good, that could be spent on maintenance and frankly - rest.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-100,
			"y":-940,
			"width":260,
			"height":340
		},
		{
			"id":"1ea7221e1bc425f4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Beauty",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":1340,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"a47e2753e3d0a460",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Our politics don’t dictate how susceptible we are to propaganda",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":1420,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"0a7b2a05af7e18f3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Quirks",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1000,
			"y":-500,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"5ba6abf78db8713c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Weighted Dice - can manipulate all throws in your favour or against.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1060,
			"y":-420,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"b66c391b24d71af6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Unlucky - things don’t often go your way. But failure suits you, charming in its of way.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1060,
			"y":-300,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"926a55c9e3b185bd",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Allergies - can’t eat everything, but hyper aware of ingredients, nutri stats etc",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1060,
			"y":-180,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"a9da0b285eaeb86b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Art-Critic",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1060,
			"y":-60,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"abcabc61c3afc523",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Sales man + art afficionado = art dealer",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1060,
			"y":20,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"f7e09100ff0c1b31",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Mechanics",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1380,
			"y":-500,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"532e754fe74b50d0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The way you see the world might change. Same world, different skin. Depending on your choices and worldview this skin could be altered or exchanged.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1420,
			"y":-420,
			"width":260,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"606cd7d33e4f320b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Drugs and alcohol as a crutch when the going gets tough.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1700,
			"y":-420,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"ba7ba863c01221d0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Hanging Paintings:\n\nDecoration slots. Discover them by looking around or buying them.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1700,
			"y":-340,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"2f49a30ea2737c93",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The player can learn much earlier that the world probably didn’t end, at which point it’s their character they need to build to make him admit it to himself and his family.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1420,
			"y":-220,
			"width":260,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"3625931f07c9157c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Maybe resource management doesn’t need to be that big a factor? Look at how Twd s1 handled it. Many small actions have an impact on how characters see Lee. Might this be enough?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1700,
			"y":-180,
			"width":260,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"41bf43e31734dff0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Clear mechanics to manipulate \n\nBoth into going to the bunker, but also leaving it.\n\nThe second one is pointed out that Daryl still thinks he’s the he arbiter of what should be done. That his skill gives him the right to decide for others.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1420,
			"y":-20,
			"width":260,
			"height":300
		},
		{
			"id":"bc992fd41817927d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Emoengine\n\nCharacter expressions should remain consistent between dialogue blocks. Blocks can alter or add nuance. Certain emotional states don’t allow for certain dialogue. Test this!!",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1700,
			"y":40,
			"width":260,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"289d32be10014a7a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Daryl comes up with stories and fables and myths to explain things or to motivate the kids to do their chores",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1700,
			"y":280,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"7a4eb9c0d463312c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Bonuses on skill checks for acting appropriately\n\n-> dominance? -> stand on above them, orate down\n\nIncentivize through interesting camera angles",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1420,
			"y":300,
			"width":260,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"61be34423156b3f6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Paranoia - Foresight +\n\nActing in character rewarded different from against character (growth)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":560,
			"y":-420,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"fb4218b43cd3de97",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"how much should you expect people to have the why engine running",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":1540,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"6f4f160bdc77818c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"When a system reaches a certain complexity it becomes nigh unpredictable both in what it does and in how it’s understood.\n\nBut There is a quality in that. But to try and control it..?\n\nYou can intentionally let go. Is what happened after intentional?\n\nWhen did you become so pensive?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1480,
			"y":-120,
			"width":260,
			"height":380
		},
		{
			"id":"07b591c37afb8183",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The only character allowed to make erratic decisions is the player. Everyone else must be smart people doing smart things. Even if the player isn’t.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1760,
			"y":-80,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"c53473d89735cedc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Tassen fallen, keine Tassen!",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1760,
			"y":80,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"cf85202b2046c499",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Artist is something others should call you",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1760,
			"y":160,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"54f7274267834571",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"cat approach:\ndont preach, instead\nBut wants to send a message\n\nHere’s me sharing what I think is beautiful",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1760,
			"y":240,
			"width":260,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"b886e9c40f1dbeb6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Misc",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1800,
			"y":-720,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"c499424705d4ca1d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Apocalypse did happen.\n\nPeople turn up with things to trade.\n\nShoot them immediately?\n\nSets off sequence of events where the mostly peaceful group grows resentful towards Daryl and decides to steer clear. No trade, no exchange. Further isolation. Eventually a well armed group turns up. They, too wish to trade.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1760,
			"y":-620,
			"width":260,
			"height":360
		},
		{
			"id":"0ad6ce3690133914",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"How would even god know to find me?\n\nMany Aprils buried.\n\nUnderground\n\n  \n\nMakes me wish for\n\nNo more gilded Cage\n\nTurned to stone\n\n  \n\nGrave mistake\n\nNo Achieving heaven unless buried",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1480,
			"y":-620,
			"width":260,
			"height":400
		},
		{
			"id":"2d6fcfd594dcc94c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Everyone distrustful, selfish and rich/powerful enough to hide in bunkers and facilities left the world to those who weren’t. A utopia is born.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1760,
			"y":-240,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"42a156dbe163a309",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"only way to heaven is undergroud",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1480,
			"y":-200,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"60b7eaaaf717411f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"18.04.2025 -> checkout",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1320,
			"y":840,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"4208d0d3f574f5bf",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"26.06.2026",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1300,
			"y":600,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		}
	],
